  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A fix release. The dashboard now mounts on Umbraco 17 and 18. Those versions call provideContext() on a dashboard element as they mount it, and the dashboard was a plain HTMLElement without it, so the mount threw and Settings > PWA stayed empty. 0.5.3 said the dashboard worked on Umbraco 16 to 18; it did not on 17 and 18, because this error came first. No API, configuration or schema changes. Full changelog: https://github.com/BaryoDev/umbraco-pwa/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
